tags: govt_affairs, cabinet

= Queer Rights

Marriage for all has been law since 2017, and the self-determination law since 2024. But attacks on Pride events and queer people are rising, especially in the East, and the AfD has promised to repeal what it can. Activists want rights that a future majority cannot easily take away.

- @repeal_175: Add sexual identity to Article 3 of the Basic Law.
- @reform_183: Reform family law for children with two mothers.
- @change_sex: Start a national action plan against queer-hostile violence.
- @return: Do not enact any changes for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@repeal_175
subtitle: Needs a two-thirds majority, and so the votes of the Union.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have the support for this.
view-if: repealed_175 == 0
choose-if: progressive_coalition >= 50 and cdu_relation >= 40
on-arrival: repealed_175 = 1; homosexual_rights += 1; cdu_relation -= 3; linke_relation += 4*(1-dissent); greens_relation += 4*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1 if (in_grand_coalition or in_weimar_coalition); catholics_spd -= 2; new_middle_spd += 2*(1-dissent)

The Basic Law now protects people from discrimination for their sexual identity, alongside sex, origin and faith. After long talks, enough of the Union votes yes. The AfD votes against.

@reform_183
subtitle: Today the second mother has to adopt her own child.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have majority support for this.
view-if: reformed_183 == 0
choose-if: progressive_coalition >= 50
on-arrival: reformed_183 = 1; homosexual_rights += 1; cdu_relation -= 3; linke_relation += 4*(1-dissent); greens_relation += 4*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1 if (in_grand_coalition or in_weimar_coalition); catholics_spd -= 2

The second mother of a child is now its parent from birth, without a long adoption process.

@change_sex
subtitle: Protection for Pride events, training for police, and support for victims.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have majority support for this.
view-if: trans_rights == 0
choose-if: progressive_coalition >= 50
on-arrival: trans_rights = 1; homosexual_rights += 1; budget -= 1 if budget > 0; linke_relation += 4*(1-dissent); greens_relation += 4*(1-dissent); trust_in_democracy += 1

We fund protection for Pride events, train police and prosecutors to record queer-hostile crimes, and support counselling centres in rural areas.

Of course, the far right accuses us of "gender ideology".
